menuconfig DRIVERS_HPM_TSNS
	bool "hpm_tsns"
	default n
	---help---
		Driver for the HPM6E80 on-die temperature sensor (TSNS).

		The die temperature is published once per second through the
		debug_key_value topic with the key "SOC_TEMP".  The logger records it
		and MAVLink forwards it to the ground station as NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT.
